id: pm-a8lnoh
title: "Deterministic fault and concurrency simulation harness: seeded, reproducible interleavings and IO failures replayed against the SDK"
description: ""
type: Task
status: open
priority: 1
tags[8]: "area:sdk",ci,concurrency,defect-detection,durability,multi-agent,simulation,testing
created_at: "2026-07-24T23:46:28.176Z"
updated_at: "2026-07-24T23:46:28.176Z"
author: maintainer-agent
estimated_minutes: 3600
acceptance_criteria: "A seeded scheduler drives concurrent claim, mutate, commit, merge, and compaction operations with reproducible interleavings from a single seed; Fault injection covers partial writes, fsync failure, EIO, ENOSPC, process kill between journal and apply, and lock-holder death; After every simulated schedule, workspace invariants are asserted: history chain verifies, storage integrity validates, no lost update, no duplicate id, no orphaned lock; A failing schedule reports a seed that reproduces the failure deterministically, and the seed is recordable on the resulting pm item; Nightly runs sweep a seed corpus; discovered failing seeds become permanent regression cases"
goal: ci-detects-every-defect
objective: Concurrency and crash bugs are found by a deterministic search rather than by production flakes
value: "The known open races — lock-free workspace singleton writes, id reservation TOCTOU, stale-lock reclamation — were all found by reasoning or by luck, not by tests. At thousands of concurrent agents, luck stops scaling."
impact: "Converts the entire class of concurrency and partial-write defects from intermittent production surprises into reproducible, bisectable failures with a seed."
outcome: "A seeded simulator drives concurrent SDK operations and injected IO faults, asserts workspace invariants after every schedule, and reports a failing seed that reproduces exactly."
why_now: "Multi-agent operation is a stated product requirement and the storage layer just gained transactions, merge drivers, and history reanchoring — the invariants are now rich enough to be worth checking mechanically, and complex enough that review alone will not."
parent: pm-dj98
risk: high
confidence: medium
